{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877320/extras/903002511a6315cfea4c9e8f361041cd.poster.avif?t=1753395922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877320/extras/903002511a6315cfea4c9e8f361041cd.webm?t=1753395922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the prologue of a dark narrative adventure, where nothing is what it seems and every decision leaves a mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this <i>The Next Stop</i> demo, you'll play <strong>Chapter 0</strong> \u2014 a first ride through a mysterious subway where the lives of eight strangers intertwine. A murder, contradictory clues, and a protagonist who begins to question everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee4\ufe0f <strong>Explore the first carriage</strong><br>Move freely through a confined space, examine objects, uncover hidden details, and solve small puzzles that test your observation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877320/extras/65fbda37b7b80ceb26e9252f1936d1d8.poster.avif?t=1753395922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877320/extras/65fbda37b7b80ceb26e9252f1936d1d8.webm?t=1753395922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Talk to the passengers</strong><br>Speak, lie, stay silent \u2014 every choice shapes your path. But remember: someone is always watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877320/extras/ab967d7894500904cc492c23cecf7897.poster.avif?t=1753395922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877320/extras/ab967d7894500904cc492c23cecf7897.webm?t=1753395922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Immerse yourself in the atmosphere</strong><br>An unsettling soundscape, a haunting visual style, and a subway hiding something far more disturbing than it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877320/extras/c5b25f2f5c01ef2e487f5d902b3977f5.poster.avif?t=1753395922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877320/extras/c5b25f2f5c01ef2e487f5d902b3977f5.webm?t=1753395922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this opening chapter, you\u2019ll play as <strong>Kane</strong>, a man trapped between memory and fear, as he begins a journey filled with difficult choices, mysteries, and psychological tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready: this subway doesn\u2019t just take you somewhere... it takes you deep into your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877320/extras/02b2d36e2051d7e6fff246b7d37406b3.poster.avif?t=1753395922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877320/extras/02b2d36e2051d7e6fff246b7d37406b3.webm?t=1753395922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3877320?t=1753395922